Dataset contains:

* Orders (~51K rows)
* Customers (~9K rows)
* Products (~1.9K rows)
* Payments
* Shipping
* Returns

Key columns:

* order_id, customer_id, product_id
* quantity, unit_price, discount
* sales, profit, payment_method, ship_mode

