# 📉 **12. Outlier Detection**

```python
quantiles = df.approxQuantile("revenue", [0.25, 0.75], 0)
Q1, Q3 = quantiles
IQR = Q3 - Q1

df_outliers = df.filter((col("revenue") < Q1 - 1.5*IQR) |
                        (col("revenue") > Q3 + 1.5*IQR))
```

